id=susfs_lkm_x64
name=SUSFS LKM x86_64
version=v0.0.4
versionCode=4
author=ymuuu, inforcqb
description=Loads the x86_64 susfs LKM at boot on the android12-5.10 .. android17-6.18 x86_64 GKI kernels, auto-selected by kernel release (runtime-tested on the Android 16 x86_64 emulator, android15-6.6; the rest are CI-built). sus_path now hides readlinkat answers too; synced with upstream susfs4ksu-lkm through 6753d9c. Also installs the x86_64 susfs CLI. Port repo: susfs4ksu-lkm-x64.
